+{
+  "tool": "built-in image_gen",
+  "transparent_background": true,
+  "prompts": {
+    "leaf-single": "Use case: ads-marketing. Create ONE decorative photographic cutout asset for a premium fresh-juice website: leaf-single.png. Reference image 1 is website context ONLY; reference image 2 is material/style reference ONLY. Match the existing asset's glossy photorealistic freshness, rich deep green leaves, detailed natural texture and soft studio lighting. Subject: exactly ONE fresh strawberry leaf, broad ovate shape with a serrated edge, visible branching veins, slight natural curve, short delicate stem. Leaf tilted about 30 degrees from vertical. Single subject centered, entirely visible, generous transparent padding (about 15% margin), square canvas 1024x1024 if available. True transparent background with real alpha, finely antialiased clean edge. Sharp photographic botanical detail, realistic subtly glossy highlights. NO fruit, no extra leaves, no text, no logo, no splash, no floating drops, no ground shadow, no floor, no background scene, no checkerboard baked into pixels. Reference images must not be reproduced; create only the specified single leaf.",
+    "leaf-pair": "Use case: ads-marketing. Generate ONE separate photorealistic decorative cutout for a fresh juice website, leaf-pair.png. Reference 1 is website corner-decoration context ONLY. Reference 2 is material/style reference ONLY: match fresh deep-green serrated strawberry leaves, crisp realistic veins, slightly glossy natural highlights, soft studio lighting. Subject: exactly TWO strawberry leaves growing from ONE short shared stem, fanned apart gracefully, one larger and one smaller. Broad ovate strawberry leaflets, naturally serrated edges, slight organic curvature. Whole connected cluster centered and fully visible, generous transparent padding on all sides, square 1024x1024 canvas if possible, subject occupying roughly 70% of frame. Real alpha transparent background, clean soft antialiased cutout edges. No fruit, no third leaf, no text, no logo, no splash, no ground shadow, no floor, no scene, no baked checkerboard. Return only this two-leaf cluster, no website layout.",
+    "strawberry-whole": "Use case: ads-marketing. Create ONE decorative photographic cutout asset strawberry-whole.png for a fresh-juice website. Reference image 1: context for small fruit-and-leaf corner decoration only. Reference image 2: material and photographic style only. Match that asset's glossy photoreal saturated ruby-red strawberry, deep-green fresh leaves, detailed realistic seeds and soft studio lighting, WITHOUT its liquid splash. Subject: exactly ONE whole ripe red strawberry, green calyx and one small serrated strawberry leaf attached naturally to a short stem, fruit slightly angled about 20 degrees. Several clear realistic water droplets on the red skin (attached droplets only). Natural appetizing conical strawberry shape, premium sharp product photography, no plastic appearance. Entire subject centered, fully visible, ample transparent padding on every side; square 1024x1024 canvas if available, subject fits inside central 70%. Genuinely transparent background with real alpha and clean antialiased edges. NO text, logos, liquid splash, floating droplets, ground shadow, surface, scene, extra fruit, or baked checkerboard. Generate only this single fruit cutout, not a website.",
+    "strawberry-half-leaf": "Use case: ads-marketing. Generate ONE separate decorative photoreal cutout asset strawberry-half-leaf.png for a fresh juice website. Reference 1 is corner-decoration usage context only. Reference 2 is photographic material/style reference only: match saturated glossy ruby-red strawberries, deep-green serrated leaves, visible seeds, fresh appetizing details and soft studio lighting. Subject is ONE compact centered arrangement containing exactly one whole ripe strawberry and ONE lengthwise sliced half beside it, with ONE fresh deep-green strawberry leaf behind them. Whole fruit has its natural green calyx. Sliced half presents its juicy red-white flesh to camera: pale central core, realistic fibrous red interior, thin red seeded exterior. Sliced half slightly in front and partly overlapping whole berry. Whole arrangement fully visible, modest natural angles, centered with generous 15% transparent padding on every side. Square 1024x1024 canvas if possible. Real alpha transparent background, finely antialiased clean edges. No other fruit, no extra slices, no text, logo, splash, floating drops, ground shadow, floor, props, scene or baked checkerboard. Photographic realism, not illustration, plastic or icon."
+  }
+}

